{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8AZR9RvEUtxSgAQ9xP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I calculate US Steel's FY2024 inventory turnover at about **6.55 times**. That means it cleared its average inventory roughly every 56 days.\n\nI used the standard formula: cost of goods sold divided by average inventory. Both figures come from the FY2024 10-K's financial data (XBRL).\n\n| Item | Value |\n|---|---|\n| FY2024 cost of goods sold (calendar 2024) | $14,060 million |\n| Inventory, net, 31 Dec 2023 | $2,128 million |\n| Inventory, net, 31 Dec 2024 | $2,168 million |\n| Average inventory | ($2,128M + $2,168M) / 2 = $2,148 million |\n| **Inventory turnover** | $14,060M / $2,148M ≈ **6.55x** |\n| Days inventory outstanding | 365 / 6.55 ≈ **55.8 days** |\n\n- Using only year-end inventory gives $14,060M / $2,168M ≈ 6.49x.\n- The year before, FY2023 turnover was about 7.0x ($15,803M divided by an average inventory of $2,243.5M). So inventory moved somewhat more slowly in 2024, mainly because cost of goods sold fell.\n- The inventory figures are net of LIFO and valuation reserves. Turnover would come out differently on a non-LIFO basis.\n\nSources:\n- United States Steel Corp (CIK 1163302), Form 10-K for FY2024, filed 2025-01-31, accession 0001163302-25-000018. This gives FY2024 cost of goods sold and inventory at 31 Dec 2023 and 31 Dec 2024.\n- United States Steel Corp, Form 10-K for FY2023, filed 2024-02-02, accession 0001163302-24-000009. This gives the FY2023 comparison figures."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1676,"cache_read_input_tokens":8312,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1676},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fafcdef6-f3a3-43fe-84c5-07fcab658de1","uuid":"08507667-d85d-4c52-8953-34d345a37d74","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:17:37.857Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ8AZ83HRQPxpX1ktvpR"}
